  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-24T01:44:01.927Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "At this point, I ran into this issue several times already, where I have worlds favourited that get set to private or get deleted, and I can't figure out what worlds these were, that now just shows up as unavailable.\n\nIt would be really nice to be able to see information about such worlds still, like the name of the world, the picture, and the description. Of course we wouldn't be able to visit the world anymore, but we would be able to navigate to the creator's profile for example, to see what other worlds they made / if they made a new version of the world that is now gone.\n\nThis could also be done with avatars, as those disappear more often than worlds.",
